Subject: Cantor SJS Compiled Lookahead Stitch P0 Data Design 2026-08-30

@ [data_design_uuid] f5ee7b67-08d9-4bf8-bcd9-b883274321e8

& [Entities]
  + ExactScope LookaheadStitchDeclaration SemanticTurn SourceBinding Predicate Observation InvocationCoordinate
  + CompiledPacket LifecycleReceipt ProjectionRecord Envelope Verification EvidenceManifest

& [Keys]
  + UUID identities are lowercase nonnil and distinct where required
  + digests are uppercase SHA256 domain-separated and self-excluding
  + sets sort uniquely while KeyHints observation order and invocation order remain semantic

& [Relations]
  + request owns one scope one packet one or two declarations and ordered observations and coordinates
  + declaration references the exact scope and sources; replacement references one terminal predecessor
  + projection references one coordinate one packet and every currently active stitch

& [Bounds]
  + request 1 MiB evidence 8 MiB depth 40 fields 16384 stitches 2 hints and sources 8 observations 64 coordinates 32 projected bytes 8192
